    Bug 2009264 - Overhaul how read-only checking in AddrBookDirectory works. r=mkmelin
    Setting a flag to override read-only checks has never been a satisfying solution. It's incompatible
    with async code because it could allow user-triggered writes to happen while the flag is set.

    In this patch I add a better way to avoid read-only checks for code that is allowed to do so.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D279077

